1321:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/pbuf.c **** /**
1322:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/pbuf.c ****  * Copies data into a single pbuf (*not* into a pbuf queue!) and updates
1323:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/pbuf.c ****  * the checksum while copying
1324:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/pbuf.c ****  *
1325:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/pbuf.c ****  * @param p the pbuf to copy data into
1326:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/pbuf.c ****  * @param start_offset offset of p->payload where to copy the data to
